tools+='<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE RANGE</p><h2>Five groups. One question first.</h2></div><p>Which vehicle carries it, what powers it and how deep it must work. Figures are from the manufacturer brochure.</p></div><div class="cards">'
tools+=''.join(f'<article class="card"><span class="number">0{i} / {len(items)} MODELS</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p><ul class="clean-list">'+''.join(f'<li><strong>{m}</strong> · {esc(v)}</li>' for m,v in items)+'</ul></article>' for i,(t,d,items) in enumerate(TOOL_GROUPS,1))
tools+='</div></section>'
tools+='<section class="section band"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">COMPATIBILITY</p><h2>Match the tool to the vehicle.</h2><p>The brochure does not publish a tool-to-vehicle matrix. Compatibility is confirmed for each enquiry against the supplied vehicle version.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><caption class="sr-only">Tool compatibility checks</caption><thead><tr><th>Group</th><th>What to confirm</th><th>Compatible vehicles</th></tr></thead><tbody>'
tools+=''.join(f'<tr><th scope="row">{g}</th><td>{w}</td><td>Confirmed on enquiry</td></tr>' for g,w in [('Manipulator arms','Mounting point, payload and trim, electrical interface and control'),('Intervention tools','Hydraulic or water supply, pressure, reaction forces and vehicle stability'),('Measurement & sampling','Mounting, power, data link and recording software'),('Thrusters','Vehicle model, connector, control electronics and thrust allocation'),('Release hooks','Load, release method, trigger signal and recovery plan')])
tools+='</tbody></table></div><p class="meta">Figures from the manufacturer’s 2026 product introduction.</p></div></section>'
tools+='<section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">QUESTIONS</p><h2>Ordering tools and accessories.</h2>'+faq([('Can tools be ordered separately?','Tools and accessories can be quoted with a vehicle or on their own. Availability, lead time and export conditions are confirmed per enquiry.'),('Will they fit another manufacturer’s ROV?','Mechanical, electrical, hydraulic and communication interfaces differ between vehicles. Fitting to another brand needs interface drawings and is assessed case by case.'),('Which vehicles carry hydraulic tools?','Hydraulic tools need a suitable power unit and enough payload and stability to react the tool forces. Light work-class vehicles such as the R-150 are the starting point; confirm the specific tool and vehicle combination.')])+'<p>'+button('Ask about tools & accessories','/request-a-proposal/?model=tools')+'</p></section>'+cta()
